          <ReportItems>
            <Textbox Name="Textbox3">
              <CanGrow>true</CanGrow>
              <KeepTogether>true</KeepTogether>
              <Paragraphs>
                <Paragraph>
                  <TextRuns>
                    <TextRun>
                      <Value>1. Kindly supply the above in good order and as per our instructions and specification agreed upon. Any changing specification must get </Value>
                      <Style>
                        <FontFamily>Verdana</FontFamily>
                        <FontSize>7pt</FontSize>
                      </Style>
                    </TextRun>
                  </TextRuns>
                  <Style />
                </Paragraph>
                <Paragraph>
                  <TextRuns>
                    <TextRun>
                      <Value>    acceptance from SSN.  </Value>
                      <Style>
                        <FontFamily>Verdana</FontFamily>
                        <FontSize>7pt</FontSize>
                      </Style>
                    </TextRun>
                  </TextRuns>
                  <Style />
                </Paragraph>
                <Paragraph>
                  <TextRuns>
                    <TextRun>
                      <Value>2. Our P/O number and details description must appear in all your invoices, delivery orders and correspondences.
3. SSN reserves the right to reject any items or lots that do not comply with the specification.
4. We will not make payment for over delivered goods.</Value>
                      <Style>
                        <FontFamily>Verdana</FontFamily>
                        <FontSize>7pt</FontSize>
                      </Style>
                    </TextRun>
                  </TextRuns>
                  <Style />
                </Paragraph>
                <Paragraph>
                  <TextRuns>
                    <TextRun>
                      <Value>5. In case of delay delivery , the supplier is obliged to pay a penalty to Mercator. The rate of penalty is charged at 1% of everyday   </Value>
                      <Style>
                        <FontFamily>Verdana</FontFamily>
                        <FontSize>7pt</FontSize>
                      </Style>
                    </TextRun>
                  </TextRuns>
                  <Style />
                </Paragraph>
                <Paragraph>
                  <TextRuns>
                    <TextRun>
                      <Value>    starting counting from the delivery date agreed in PO. However, the maximum penalty amount will not exceed 30% of the order value.</Value>
                      <Style>
                        <FontFamily>Verdana</FontFamily>
                        <FontSize>7pt</FontSize>
                      </Style>
                    </TextRun>
                  </TextRuns>
                  <Style />
                </Paragraph>
              </Paragraphs>
              <rd:DefaultName>Textbox3</rd:DefaultName>
              <Top>1.89999in</Top>
              <Left>0.13392in</Left>
              <Height>0.90903in</Height>
              <Width>7.16167in</Width>
              <Visibility>
                <Hidden>=Parameters!HideFooterText.Value</Hidden>
              </Visibility>
              <Style>
                <Border>
                  <Style>None</Style>
                </Border>
                <PaddingRight>2pt</PaddingRight>
              </Style>
            </Textbox>
            <Textbox Name="Textbox5">
              <CanGrow>true</CanGrow>
              <KeepTogether>true</KeepTogether>
              <Paragraphs>
                <Paragraph>
                  <TextRuns>
                    <TextRun>
                      <Value>="Page "+Globals!PageNumber.ToString()+" of "+Globals!TotalPages.ToString()</Value>
                      <Style>
                        <FontFamily>Verdana</FontFamily>
                        <FontSize>8pt</FontSize>
                      </Style>
                    </TextRun>
                  </TextRuns>
                  <Style>
                    <TextAlign>Right</TextAlign>
                  </Style>
                </Paragraph>
              </Paragraphs>
              <rd:DefaultName>Textbox5</rd:DefaultName>
              <Top>1.89999in</Top>
              <Left>0.25413in</Left>
              <Height>0.15903in</Height>
              <Width>7.58614in</Width>
              <ZIndex>1</ZIndex>
